            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <h2>v1.5.49 Update</h2>
<ul>
    <li><b>Inline AI response bubble fix</b><br>
        - Assistant response bubbles now appear immediately when sending follow-up messages.
    </li>
    <li><b>Inline AI loading animation</b><br>
        - Replaced the temporary text placeholder with animated loading dots while the provider is responding.
    </li>
    <li><b>Empty response handling</b><br>
        - Inline AI now shows an explicit error in the assistant bubble if a provider stream finishes without content.
    </li>
</ul>
                ]]>
